------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Models
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MedMCP is model-agnostic: it talks to whatever model the local Ollama server
serves and does not redistribute any model weights. The default configuration
(Modelfile.gemma4) builds on Google's Gemma. When Gemma is used, it is provided
under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use; that model and any derivative of it
(including the custom "gemma4-medmcp" build) carry Google's attribution and
use-restriction obligations:

  - Gemma Terms of Use:   https://ai.google.dev/gemma/terms
  - Prohibited Use Policy: https://ai.google.dev/gemma/prohibited_use_policy

Operators who swap in a different model are responsible for complying with that
model's own license and use terms.

